/-!
# A214670

Triangle, read by rows of n*(n+1)/2 terms, where row n equals the coefficients in the series reversion of the function G(x,n)-1 such that: x = Sum_{m>=1} 1/G(x,n)^(n*m) * Product_{k=1..m} (1 - 1/G(x,n)^k), for n>=1.

The 56 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

